### Core State Principles
Single Source of Truth:
- Centralized state management
- Clear ownership of state updates
- Predictable state transitions
- Atomic state operations

Update Frequency:
- Global 1-second update timer
- Batch related state changes
- Optimize update scheduling
- Handle state dependencies

### Update Timing Hierarchy
// Referenced by:
// - @battle-animation-standards.mdc#Core-Timing-Principles
// - @battle-targeting-system.mdc#Combat-Sequence#Frontend-Flow
// - @battle-movement-system.mdc#Movement-Feedback#Visual-Updates
// - @battle-visual-feedback.mdc#Combat-Effects#Animation-Timing
// - @battle-node-control.mdc#Capture-System#Visual-Feedback

Core Update Requirements:
1. Real-time (60fps): Animations, movement, visual effects
   - Use requestAnimationFrame for smooth updates
   - Implement RAF fallback for background tabs
   - Required for smooth visual feedback

2. Speed-based: Attack animations (per battalion speed stat)
   - Duration = 1000ms / speed stat
   - Use Animated.timing with proper easing
   - Critical for consistent combat pacing

3. Global timer (1s): Health, damage, state synchronization
   - Align with backend update cycle
   - Buffer state changes for smooth transitions
   - Ensures consistent game state

State Categories:
1. Battle State:
   - Phase tracking
   - Timer management
   - Victory conditions
   - Node ownership

2. Battalion State:
   - Position tracking
   - Health/status
   - Target information
   - Movement paths

3. Combat State:
   - Attack calculations
   - Damage resolution
   - Range checking
   - Collision detection

### State Updates
Update Process:
- Validate state changes
- Batch related updates
- Maintain consistency
- Handle edge cases

Error Handling:
- Validate state transitions
- Recover from failures
- Log state errors
- Maintain fallback states

### State Synchronization
Timing Requirements:
- Sync with global timer
- Handle network delays
- Manage animation states
- Coordinate multiple updates

Performance Optimization:
- Minimize state updates
- Batch similar changes
- Optimize calculations
- Monitor update frequency 